    {
      "source": "Install or remove an <a href=\"../../support/ExecutorChannelInterceptor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.support\"><code>ExecutorChannelInterceptor</code></a> that invokes a\ncompletion task, if found in the headers of the message.",
      "translation": "安装或删除一个<a href=\"../../support/ExecutorChannelInterceptor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.support\"><code>ExecutorChannelInterceptor</code></a>，如果它在消息的头部中找到了完成任务，则调用该任务。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether the channel has been <a href=\"#configureInterceptor(org.springframework.messaging.MessageChannel,boolean)\"><code>configured</code></a>\nwith an interceptor for sequential handling.",
      "translation": "该通道是否已使用拦截器配置为顺序处理，参见<a href=\"#configureInterceptor(org.springframework.messaging.MessageChannel,boolean)\"><code>configured</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "This method may block indefinitely, depending on the implementation.\nTo provide a maximum wait time, use <a href=\"../../MessageChannel.html#send(org.springframework.messaging.Message,long)\"><code>MessageChannel.send(Message, long)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "此方法可能会根据实现情况无限期阻塞。若要指定最大等待时间，请使用<a href=\"../../MessageChannel.html#send(org.springframework.messaging.Message,long)\"><code>MessageChannel.send(Message, long)</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
