    {
      "source": "Decorator for an <a href=\"../../support/ExecutorSubscribableChannel.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.support\"><code>ExecutorSubscribableChannel</code></a> that ensures messages\nare processed in the order they were published to the channel. Messages are\nsent one at a time with the next one released when the previous has been\nprocessed. This decorator is intended to be applied per session.",
      "translation": "用于<a href=\"../../support/ExecutorSubscribableChannel.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.support\"><code>ExecutorSubscribableChannel</code></a>的装饰器，可确保消息按照发布到通道的顺序进行处理。消息一次发送一条，在上一条被处理后释放下一条。此装饰器旨在按会话应用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Send a <a href=\"../../Message.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>Message</code></a> to this channel.",
      "translation": "向此通道发送一个<a href=\"../../Message.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>Message</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain the task to release the next message, if found.",
      "translation": "获取下一个消息的发布任务（如果找到）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Send a message, blocking until either the message is accepted or the\nspecified timeout period elapses.",
