      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../MessageChannel.html#send(org.springframework.messaging.Message,long)\">send</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"../../MessageChannel.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging\">MessageChannel</a></code>` 中",
